WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.790
What do you plan on doing, Sherry?

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.420
There's only one thing to do.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:53.670
There's no reason for me to
get involved with that kid.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.720
It's not their power
level that concerns me.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.760
We have to end this nonsense
as soon as possible.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.890
As soon as possible!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:06.480
{Part A}

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.940
The Battle Between 100 Demons

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.400
- Later. See you tomorrow.
- Yeah.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.620
Out of the way, out of the way!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.920
Hey Suzume, hold on to that properly!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.090
It's heavy...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.800
Choir Club

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.890
Hey, let's get going.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.510
The music room is only a
bit further, after all.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.890
You can do it, Suzume.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.310
Takamine-kun, are you going home?

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.610
I'll see you later!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:05.700
I wonder what's wrong with him.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.870
He's been out of it all day.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.710
I wonder if something happened to him...

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.840
Suzume...

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.800
You have some nerve...

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.050
Sorry, Mariko-chan!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.980
Yesterday's fight...

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.520
The fight against the kid
who looked like Gash...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.280
Why would a human child
have power like this?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.610
He is a monster!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.540
Somehow, we won the fight, but...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.930
Gash finally found out...
about his power.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.890
Gash, let's go home.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.680
Kiyomaro...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.180
What is it?

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:15.100
That kid shot ice out of his mouth,

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:20.240
and he had a blue book similar to the
red book I've always held on to.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:26.200
When we destroyed the rooftop, that time
at the bank, and even in this fight...

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:36.630
I thought that you were using a strange skill
or mechanically bringing out the lightning...

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.340
But I'm wrong, aren't I?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.130
Kiyomaro, answer me honestly...

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:49.600
I have the power to make lightning
come out of my mouth, don't I?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.600
Just like that kid...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.270
Yeah, that's right...

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.900
Oh, I see...

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.240
I'm... I'm a monster!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.910
Damn it.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:16.420
After that, the kid who used to always
be happy, stopped talking...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.920
How should I approach him?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.590
How should I cheer him up?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.300
It better be true this time.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.680
Otherwise, we won't accept you.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.680
Gash!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.560
What in the world is he doing up there?

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.100
Could it be that he's going to jump?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.400
Stop, Gash!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.610
Come forth, lightning!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.790
Hey, nothing came out!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.130
You said you could release lightning!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.380
Liar, liar!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:04.050
Shut up! It really does come out!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:08.130
Fine then, I'll do it this time on that slide.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:12.510
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:15.220
Oh, Kiyomaro! Good timing.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.390
How did I release lightning before?

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.980
I've been trying to figure it out.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.980
You idiot!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.900
That hurts, Kiyomaro...

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.660
Oh yeah, I'll introduce them to you.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.660
These are my new friends.
I met them at the park today.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:38.120
From the left, Naomi-chan, Hideaki-kun,
Kogorou-kun, and Herohuki-kun.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.000
Hey, wait a minute. We never said
anything about being friends.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.220
We said that if you really could release
lightning, we would become your friends.

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.090
Gash, you can't really release lightning.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.720
I understand...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.220
I'll release lightning, so be patient.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.440
Which is why I need to release lightning!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.190
Kiyomaro, please do me this one favor.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.610
Quit messing around...

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:11.660
I said quit messing around, you idiot!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.570
K-Kiyomaro...

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.160
Looks like he got in trouble.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.250
Want to go home?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.250
Yeah.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.870
Go home, go home!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.790
Hey, Gash!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.880
I was really worried about you.
What do you think you're doing?

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.970
What's wrong?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.260
I can release lightning, which means
I'm better than a normal person.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.430
What's wrong with trying to show it off?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.470
What do you mean, better?

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.350
If you make a mistake,
you can kill someone!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:43.230
What were you thinking?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.070
Shut up!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.410
Boasting about it is my decision!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.780
Go away, Kiyomaro!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.410
I don't want to see your face!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.700
You...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.170
Is that the way you want it?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.790
That's fine with me.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.550
I regret worrying about you.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.270
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.320
anata ga inakutemo
Even if you are gone...

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.940
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.360
hitori demo
Even if I'm alone.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.540
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.510
minna to chigakudemo
Even if everyone else is different...

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.930
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.970
kotoba mo hoshii kedo
Even though I wanted words, too.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.350
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.430
sekai ja toomawari demo
Even if the world's a detour...

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.940
doutte koto nai sa
Whatever, it's nothing.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.520
kyou mo mata tsumazuitayo
I failed again today.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.440
negaigoto nara
If you speak of wishes,

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:17.620
iroiro aru kedo
I have many desires.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:23.750
anata ga soba ni inai kara
It's because you're not by my side...

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.630
egao mo hanbun sa
that I can only manage a half-smile.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:34.220
nake bokura no hitomi ni utsuru
Why is it that while the shapes...

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:40.560
mono subete katachi ga aru noni
of everything reflect in my eyes,

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.390
What happened to your owner?

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.300
Did he abandon you?

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:48.310
daiji na mono ga itsumo tarinai you
there is never enough of the most important thing?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.810
Oh, you're alone as well?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:53.990
motto hanashi o surundayo!
Keep talking!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.820
I'm also... I'm also all alone...

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.910
yokubari sugiru to
When people are too greedy,

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.200
kowaresou sa
something's likely to break.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.500
Kiyomaro, you idiot.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.250
What's wrong with thinking
that I'm better than others?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:15.670
umarete kita no wa keshite arasou tame ja nai hazu nanoni
I could not have been born to destroy and argue.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.710
It's too depressing to
be known as a monster.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:19.260
What should I do?

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:21.850
wakachaitai yo
I want to share!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.310
That idiot...

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.270
What do you mean, you don't
want to see my face?

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.570
How much does he think
I worried about him?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:34.650
How much...

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.490
Gash...

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.930
Who the hell is it, at a time like this?

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:07.810
If it's a stupid salesperson or a
recruiting organization, I'll yell at them.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.270
My parents aren't home, so what...

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:23.070
If I show you this book, I'm guessing
you'll understand why we're here.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:40.010
{Part B}

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:59.030
Don't worry.
We just came here to talk.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.900
We don't plan on fighting.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.620
We're coming in, if you don't mind.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.580
This guy...

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.250
Is it okay?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.870
Ye...Yeah.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.920
Crap, crap...

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.460
I hate you, Kiyomaro.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.970
Have you been following me all this time?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.520
You're a good boy, aren't you...

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.320
And then...

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.670
This is Kiyomaro's house.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.170
From today on, you're my friend.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.170
Let's go take over Kiyomaro's room!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.800
Kiyomaro is going to be surprised.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.390
Is someone here?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.490
I see.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.490
So the child of the red
book lost his memory.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.530
I understand now.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.660
You... how much do you know?

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.250
What is Gash?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.000
That's right...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.000
I'll tell you.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.960
That way, I'm quite sure that you'll
hand over that book to us more easily.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.890
To explain it simply, he is a demon.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.770
That child was given a
shell of a human body.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.890
He is one of the Devil's children.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.940
A demon, you say?

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.820
That's the best way to explain it.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.860
I doubt you will believe this,

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:11.780
but he is from another world,
a world different from ours.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.910
That is... Hell?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.080
A different world?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.210
What is she saying all of a sudden?

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.250
Well, I doubt you will
believe me right now, but...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:25.970
Can you explain the
reason for his existence?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:35.270
In that hell, there is a society,
and a king who controls it.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.030
A king, you say?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.780
To decide who the next king will be,

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.580
there is a fight held in the human world
once every 1000 years.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:04.960
The 100 chosen children from that
hell are sent here with a book.

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.470
They are raised by humans, and fight each other.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.260
The rules are simple.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.020
The book that you and I carry...

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:23.610
This book reacts to the human will, and
can activate these children's powers.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.110
In other words, it's their instruction book.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:30.820
But, at the same time,
if the book burns to ashes,

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:36.620
their rights will be taken away, and
they will be sent back to hell.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.340
So that time when that kid vanished...

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.300
That means...

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.550
Yes.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:55.890
These children fight and
burn each other's books

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.850
until there is only one left
in the human world.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.650
Then, what happens to the one who lives?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.620
He will become the next ruler.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.790
That's the end of my explanation.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:30.510
Will you hand over your red book?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:36.430
Now, you know what you
involuntarily got yourself into.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.680
This is too much.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.690
I don't even know whether I should
believe her story or not.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:49.230
But I know one thing.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.110
If I hand this book over to her,
and she burns it,

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.700
Gash will be gone.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:04.830
Perhaps you have been using his power to
do evil things, and you feel good about it?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.040
What?

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.290
If that's the case, then you should stop.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:13.760
Those intentions will get
you into even more trouble.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.760
Shut up!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:21.220
I just can't believe your stupid story.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.640
I see...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:27.810
Reisu.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.510
I couldn't see that
powerful aura-like thing...

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.600
Just quietly hand that book over.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.890
I'll continue to attack you
until you hand over that book.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.310
K-Kiyomaro...

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.860
If you stay with him, you'll lose
your normal way of life.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.530
This fight isn't only about
burning each other's books.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.530
There are some who would
kill you without hesitation.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:28.210
Of course, you can hold on to that book
and intend to not get involved.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.170
But as long as you're with that child,

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.710
you'll only be inviting disaster!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.430
Go!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.650
He is a monster.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.570
Vulcan! Vulcan!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:55.980
You know what...

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.030
If you make one mistake,
you can kill someone!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.220
Well, now that you know, the red book...

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.720
Then, let me ask you.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:30.480
If you don't want to get anyone involved,

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:35.520
why do you go around burning others' books,
yet not burning your own?

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.660
You wouldn't understand.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.240
I don't ever...

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:53.960
I don't ever want to think like that.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.210
That's why...

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:02.430
That's why... I'm going to train
this kid to become the ruler.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:08.810
If you don't hand over that book,
I will take it by force, and burn it!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.770
What happened to this girl?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:19.030
Even if we let you go, enemy after
enemy will come after you.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:24.620
That's right. The battle has already begun.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.910
W-Who are you?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.960
This is Kiyomaro's house!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.630
It's all right. I'll kick this guy out.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.600
Doruku.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.230
You...

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.030
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
You are gazing up

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:35.080
{Preview}

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:40.330
Hang in there, Gash!
What are you doing?

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:43.130
Shut up. I'm a killing tool, aren't I?

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:44.840
Don't get involved with me!

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:47.420
This kid is dealing with so much pain...

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:50.930
Hurry up and hand over the book, Kiyomaro!
You're going to get killed!

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.720
I understand now. I was wrong...

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:56.100
This time, it's my turn.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.020
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:00.480
The Black Assassins, Brago and Sherry.

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:03.650
It's my turn to return the favor!

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:04.980
